## Command

```shell
biome inspect plugins '--path=<TEMP_DIR>/absolute_target_matches_includes_relative_to_configuration_directory/src/file.ts'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    "./base.grit",
    { "path": "./src-only.grit", "includes": ["src/**"] },
    { "path": "./other-only.grit", "includes": ["other/**"] }
  ]
}
```

## `base.grit`

```grit
`unterminated
```

## `other-only.grit`

```grit
`unterminated
```

## `src-only.grit`

```grit
`unterminated
```

